      "credit": "Exact source formula only; not a proved Lean clause",
      "id": "A1.Ex3.m2",
      "literal_source_alttext": "\\displaystyle\\coloneqq(x,R_{h_{\\widetilde{x}}(x)}p)\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptR_{0}\\coloneqq I\\,.",
