      "credit": "Exact source formula only; not a proved Lean clause",
      "id": "A1.Ex4.m1",
      "literal_source_alttext": "H_{y,\\widetilde{x}}(x,p)\\coloneqq\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\bigl\\{\\eta^{-1}\\,\\|x-c_{y,\\widetilde{x}}\\|^{2}+\\|p\\|^{2}\\bigr\\}\\,.",
      "source_URL": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.06905v1#A1.Ex4.m1"
    },
    {
